From 20f5abac02c51be8e1cab5d2e704dbde9fba740b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Morkel <john@morkel.me>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add the EN7581 GPON and XGS-PON MACs

Provide activation, OMCI transport and the netlink control plane above
the Ethernet PON interface. Include the parent Kconfig and kbuild hooks.
Activation is controlled by userspace. The GPON and XGS-PON paths
use separate state machines and share the frame engine PON interface.

Signed-off-by: John Morkel <john@morkel.me>
